 isolated complete-read + V126 rename lineage)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Complete-or-explicit-failure reads for frontier-model clients, with fail-closed trust preserved:

- B1 complete supported-file retrieval: assistant_source_file_read(mode="complete") reads whole
  txt/md/csv/json/xml/html/log, or extracts pdf/docx/xlsx/eml; never truncates-and-labels-complete.
- B2 parser isolation: files/parsers/isolated.py runs each parse in a spawned, setsid process-group
  child with input-size gate, RLIMIT_AS/CPU, wall-clock timeout, and an output-byte budget; parent
  survives timeout/segfault/OOM/malformed payload (process-group grandchild-kill proven).
- B3 identity/provenance: source_ref is the path-free handoff; cross-root/traversal/symlink/forged refs
  fail closed; path-free provenance block mirrors the authoritative top-level state fields.
- B4 rename/move lineage: V126 renamed_from_source_id; apply_confirmed_same_root_move links old->new in
  one transaction (old row non-current only if dest+lineage persist), no content-trust carry-forward;
  old ref answers moved+successor; cross-root/unconfirmed stays conservative (confirmed-absence).
- B5 client semantics: tool description + operating manifest updated for mode/state-vocabulary/source_ref
  handoff and honest XER/archive non-support; disambiguation gate un-deselected (health/query_plan fixed).

Centralized retrieval/content/completeness state vocabulary + contradiction-free matrix. V126 additive/
nullable/idempotent/parity-guarded. Quarantine test version literals -> LATEST_SCHEMA_VERSION (V126 bump).
Evidence bundle under docs/evidence/source-index-phase-b/. Architecture completion only — no production
DB/NAS/watcher/deploy; Phases C-H remain.

